  "operation_class": "read",
  "label": "Get all external feeds",
  "description": "Retrieves all external feeds from your Brevo account with filtering and pagination. **Use this to:** - Get an overview of all external data feeds - Find feeds by name using search functionality - Filter feeds by creation date range - Browse feeds by authentication type - Monitor feed library organization and usage **Key information returned:** - Feed details (UUID, name, URL, authentication type) - Feed configuration and settings - Creation and modification timestamps - Feed status and error information - Authentication and header configurations **Important considerations:** - External feeds e",
